1
00:04:28,695 --> 00:04:34,695
Every night a different nightmare.

2
00:08:57,391 --> 00:09:03,391
Until Dawn is a horror, mystery film directed by David F. Sandberg.

3
00:13:26,086 --> 00:13:32,086
One year after her sister Melanie mysteriously disappeared, Clover and her friends
head into the remote valley where she vanished in search of answers.

4
00:17:54,782 --> 00:18:00,782
Exploring an abandoned visitor center, they find themselves stalked by a masked killer and horrifically
murdered one by one...only to wake up and find themselves back at the beginning of the same evening.

5
00:22:23,478 --> 00:22:29,478
Clover Paul, played by Ella Rubin.

6
00:26:52,173 --> 00:26:58,173
Max, played by Michael Cimino.

7
00:31:20,869 --> 00:31:26,869
Abe, played by Belmont Cameli.

8
00:35:49,565 --> 00:35:55,565
Melanie Paul, played by Maia Mitchell.

9
00:40:18,260 --> 00:40:24,260
Dr. Alan Hill, played by Peter Stormare.

10
00:44:46,956 --> 00:44:52,956
Nina Riley, played by Odessa A'zion.

11
00:49:15,652 --> 00:49:21,652
Until Dawn is a 2025 American survival horror film adapted from the 2015 video game by PlayStation Studios, and it is set
in the same universe while featuring an original standalone story that expands upon the game's mythology.

12
00:53:44,347 --> 00:53:50,347
The film was directed by David F.

13
00:58:13,043 --> 00:58:19,043
Sandberg, and written by Gary Dauberman and Blair Butler.

14
01:02:41,739 --> 01:02:47,739
It stars Ella Rubin, Michael Cimino, Odessa A'zion, Ji-young Yoo, and Belmont Cameli as a group of friends who end up in a secluded area embedded with a time loop
mechanic; a threat is out to hunt them where dying restarts the night with a new threat each time, and the only solution is to survive until morning.

15
01:07:10,434 --> 01:07:16,434
Peter Stormare also stars, reprising his role from the game.

16
01:11:39,130 --> 01:11:45,130
In January 2024, Sony Pictures announced the film's development with
Screen Gems and PlayStation Productions set to produce.

17
01:16:07,826 --> 01:16:13,826
Casting announcements were made throughout 2024 and principal photography
took place between August and October 2024 in Budapest.

18
01:20:36,521 --> 01:20:42,521
The crew features frequent collaborators of Sandberg, including composer Benjamin
Wallfisch, cinematographer Maxime Alexandre, and editor Michel Aller.

19
01:25:05,217 --> 01:25:11,217
Until Dawn was released in the United States by Sony
Pictures Releasing on April 25, 2025.

20
01:29:33,913 --> 01:29:39,913
The film received mixed reviews from critics and grossed $54 million worldwide.

21
01:34:02,608 --> 01:34:08,608
The film explores themes of witch, haunting,
abandoned house, survival, memory loss.

22
01:38:31,304 --> 01:38:37,304
The tone is dark and mind_bending.
